Bug 2064660 - Persist RSS category tags before applying incoming filters. r=mkmelin

Create feed category tags and write their keys and the feed flag into the message before it is added. This makes tags available to incoming filters and preserves them when a filter moves the message.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327390


